command: python3 -B research/laravel-api/verify-gophp.py --help
usage: verify-gophp.py [-h] [--version {8.3,8.4,8.5}]
                       [--interpreter INTERPRETER] [--cli-only]
                       [--stress-requests STRESS_REQUESTS]

Exercise the fixed Laravel/API Platform contract through gophp --serve.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version {8.3,8.4,8.5}
  --interpreter INTERPRETER
  --cli-only            check migration, custom Artisan command and OpenAPI
                        without binding an HTTP port
  --stress-requests STRESS_REQUESTS
                        number of sustained TCP GET requests (96-2000)
exit_code: 0
